{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fd7b44ce6312119bb3852ffafdd324a11734938fc1d49afa84bb19284e998091", "ja": "（おっと、そろそろ終了の時間だな。\n撮影を止めないと……ん？）", "zh": "（哎呀，差不多该结束了。得停下拍摄才行……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2a8d257747824309dddd3262b66b1229d4f58016e9bd29f0e60caef7b0167b66", "ja": "（美希がこっちを見てる……まだ平気って事かな？\nなら、途切れるまでもう少しだけ……）", "zh": "（美希正看着这边……看来她还没事吧？\n既然这样，就再拍一会儿，直到她撑不住为止……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "96790c2e28fa9455e8f91193f09b74383608b34b03924f8d0f107244498e7c3b", "ja": "ふぅ～、疲れたの～。", "zh": "呼～，累了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1010_p", "source_sha256": "caa98e90a5445093fa5e934382e77bbe4b9aee621cf1fe0fddee0bf0ba1c86f4", "ja": "本当にお疲れ様、美希。\n撮影時間、延長させてくれてありがとうな。", "zh": "真的辛苦了，美希。\n谢谢你愿意延长拍摄时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "4d213e009b625c44a521b2cab2e2d93237a6b72b661aedd3d0fa61889738cdd5", "ja": "今日は特別なの。\nだってみんな、ミキに夢中だったでしょ？", "zh": "今天可是特别的嘛。\n因为大家都被美希迷住了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "601ff8a5e4d5ae3712c5ce801fded22ec00e114abf12103a46a85c19ea543b66", "ja": "これ、なんか面白い衣装だよね。みんなが\n写真撮りたくなっちゃうの、わかるかも。", "zh": "这套衣服感觉很有意思呢。难怪大家都会忍不住想拍照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1013_p", "source_sha256": "29f2291f8e3e8e3e54876bf46edb2091a716e2decc184174dc5e655c48994921", "ja": "確かに……\n発表された時は、かなり話題になったしな。", "zh": "确实……\n发布的时候，引发了不少话题呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "abe08f95f8cfe03ab72ee5e6105ecf0ca43138d3d3776efba32facaa120ba09e", "ja": "ねえねえ、ハニー。さっきのミキだけど……\nハニーから見て、どうだった？", "zh": "呐呐，亲爱的。刚才的美希……\n在亲爱的看来，表现得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "c740aa66c1a3873a588d2b18781d855246ca96c28485e1cd45609e43f0a6be55", "ja": "衣装にあわせたカッコいいポーズ、\nいっぱい教えてもらって、練習したんだよ？", "zh": "配合服装的帅气姿势，\n美希特地学了好多，一直在练习的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1016_p", "source_sha256": "f556eea152f4c6848d02d7fd76800b706c5f7ee85503664ae34c40fc9da495ed", "ja": "ああ、どれもすごく決まってた！\n写真の仕上がりが楽しみだよ。", "zh": "啊，每个动作都帅极了！\n真期待照片拍出来的效果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "129bb4762a4cccbe0dfc65a40c3ac1e75a3748e77dc1ba5794a2fe2815e57813", "ja": "うん！　……やっぱりミキ、\nハニーに褒めてもらえると、すっごくうれしいな♪", "zh": "嗯！……果然美希还是觉得，被亲爱的夸奖的话，会特别开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "015f773e3286b42ebea6a355e5c7ee4a09874a72e89f1fa0665d4efc6838b154", "ja": "ねえ、ハニー。これからもず～っと、\nミキのことを見ててくれる？", "zh": "呐，亲爱的。今后也会一直一直看着美希吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1019_p", "source_sha256": "57a1679c015fd36f8b864f716d5945ad09b25ebee5044a8a645be1bd9588fef0", "ja": "もちろん、見てるよ！\nけど、急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "当然会一直看着你的！\n不过，怎么突然问这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "cce8e27daa0e21e0390d3216ea2aeab027a8dc7efa2bbe7fb3eae50b0c8d6f3a", "ja": "ん～……。お話がちょっぴり切なかったからかな？\nミキ、ちょっとだけ心配になっちゃったのかも。", "zh": "嗯～……可能是因为这个故事有点令人难过吧？\n美希……好像稍微有点担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "bd4543d8cca1818c992ddf5d07083a5af13ffa03a29b8db4c79aab3f0a4aa6d6", "ja": "ハニー、長生きしてね？", "zh": "亲爱的，要长命百岁哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6c47c4d97674ae1a901dd8abb3217910ce8fa84968c326158e07d36f708b003e", "ja": "お、おう……そうだな。\n健康には気をつけるよ……。", "zh": "呃、嗯……是啊。\n我会注意健康的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "29b02556a4937141e55e98fe873995e6897171f310395c80e60db09a6c112f8a", "ja": "約束なの♪　それじゃミキは着替えるから、\nちょっとだけ待っててなの。", "zh": "说好了哦♪ 那美希要去换衣服，你稍微等一下哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0443_1024_003mik", "source_sha256": "6864715c69e58b8a28bcf4cd2926007c62724dea0f232bcf276730edbac621d6", "ja": "あ。それとも、手伝いたい？\nミキ、ハニーならいいよ？　あはっ☆", "zh": "啊。还是说，你想帮忙？\n美希的话，亲爱的就可以哦？啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
